{"id":"n35946-1-13","stage":5,"title":"근력 · 筋力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35946-1-13-1","ko":"다리의 근력을 강화하려면 어떤 운동이 좋나요?","zh":"想要增强腿部肌肉力量，适合做哪些运动呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다리의","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다리의","audio":"/audio/767ae86c2f6ad5a299cc.mp3"}},{"text":"근력을","meaning":"筋力，力量","explanation":"근력：筋力，力量；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"근력","audio":"/audio/2c6ed6e6072253120d29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35946","senseId":"1","lemma":"근력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근력을","audio":"/audio/4e8010682ca0c7e21e46.mp3"}},{"text":"강화하려면","meaning":"强化，加强","explanation":"강화하다：强化，加强；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"강화하다","audio":"/audio/a39036d148691dc7e06c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15704","senseId":"1","lemma":"강화하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강화하려면","audio":"/audio/b6bf788659c2090262b4.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"운동이","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동이","audio":"/audio/f9764d1081d03a9455b1.mp3"}},{"text":"좋나요?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋나요","audio":"/audio/ce7500390ad0e7d8920a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"2c6ed6e607225312","term":"근력","zh":"筋力，力量","audio":"/audio/2c6ed6e6072253120d29.mp3","entryId":"35946","definition":"肌肉的力量。","pronunciation":["글력"]},{"id":"a39036d148691dc7","term":"강화하다","zh":"强化，加强","audio":"/audio/a39036d148691dc7e06c.mp3","entryId":"15704","definition":"使势力或力量变得更强。","pronunciation":["강화하다"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2491bb7e4cc6ec5965c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n35946-1-13-2","ko":"등산을 해 보시는 건 어떠세요?","zh":"试试去爬山怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"등산을","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산：登山；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40293","senseId":"2","lemma":"등산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산을","audio":"/audio/abe767043d9f11e77824.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"보시는","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"